      "title": "Logging, Tracebacks and Cheat Sheet",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 4,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Logging, Tracebacks and Cheat Sheet",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Logging Setup",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`getLogger(__name__)` per module",
                "==DEBUG < INFO < WARNING < ERROR < CRITICAL==",
                "Default threshold: ==WARNING==",
                "`basicConfig` once at app entry; libraries never",
                "Lazy args, not f-strings; `exception()` logs ERROR + traceback"
              ],
              "style": "check",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "python",
              "lines": [
                "import logging",
                "def load(uid): raise KeyError(uid)",
                "uid = 7",
                "log = logging.getLogger(__name__)",
                "logging.basicConfig(level=logging.INFO, format='%(asctime)s %(levelname)s %(name)s: %(message)s')",
                "log.info('user %s', uid)",
                "try: load(uid)",
                "except KeyError: log.exception('failed')"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Reading Tracebacks",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Last line",
                    "sub": "type + message",
                    "ink": "red"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Frame above",
                    "sub": "where raised",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Frames up",
                    "sub": "callers",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "'During handling of the above exception...' = ==chained== errors",
                "`raise X from e` keeps the cause"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Tests and Cheat Sheet",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`assert 'text' in caplog.text`",
                "`caplog.set_level(logging.INFO)`"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Flag",
                "Effect"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`-k expr`",
                  "filter by name"
                ],
                [
                  "`-x`",
                  "stop at first fail"
                ],
                [
                  "`-v` / `-q`",
                  "verbose / quiet"
                ],
                [
                  "`--lf`",
                  "rerun last failed"
                ],
                [
                  "`--pdb`",
                  "pdb on failure"
                ],
                [
                  "`-s`",
                  "no capture"
                ],
                [
                  "`--tb=short`",
                  "short traceback"
                ],
                [
                  "`-m marker`",
                  "select by marker"
                ],
                [
                  "`path::test_name`",
                  "one test"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "sidebox",
              "title": "Interview Point",
              "items": [
                "**Why `getLogger(__name__)`?** Per-module names, configurable hierarchy.",
                "**Why no f-strings in logs?** Formatting is skipped when the level is off.",
                "**print vs logging?** Levels, timestamps, handlers."
              ],
              "ink": "orange"
            }
          ]
